[h2]Build 0.9.121[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]The industrial repair center can recycle.[/b] A new [i]Recycled gear[/i] button opens a filter, just like [i]Accepted gear[/i]. Anything on the item spot that the filter allows is broken down for materials instead of repaired, damaged or not, and the materials leave by the red reject chutes - the same as a recycle bill on a mending station. Use the hit-point slider to recycle only worn-out gear and repair the rest.
[*]The filter starts empty, so existing repair centers keep doing exactly what they did until you set it.
[/list]
[list]
[*]Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
